<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">考吧167 / PRACTICE</view><view class="row"><view class="title">我的题目</view><text class="link" bindtap="redeem">兑换试卷 →</text></view><view class="subtitle">一题三练，从独立思考到巩固提升。</view><view class="tabs"><view class="tab {{tab==='pending'?'active':''}}" data-tab="pending" bindtap="tab">待作答</view><view class="tab {{tab==='review'?'active':''}}" data-tab="review" bindtap="tab">批改中</view><view class="tab {{tab==='done'?'active':''}}" data-tab="done" bindtap="tab">三练完成</view><view class="tab {{tab==='all'?'active':''}}" data-tab="all" bindtap="tab">全部</view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" bindtap="load">{{error}} · 点击重试</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="muted">正在加载…</view><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="card" bindtap="open" data-id="{{item.id}}"><view class="row"><text class="badge">{{item.question.category}} · {{item.question.year || '专项'}}</text><text class="muted">{{item.statusText}}</text></view><view class="card-title" style="margin-top:20rpx">{{item.title}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.roundText}} · {{item.question.wordLimit}} 字 · {{item.question.maxScore}} 分</view><view wx:if="{{item.progressText}}" class="progress-line">{{item.progressText}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.scores.length > 1}}" class="muted">累计变化 {{item.improvement > 0 ? '+' : ''}}{{item.improvement}} 分</view></view><view wx:if="{{!items.length && !loading}}" class="empty">这里还没有题目
可使用兑换码或联系老师授权</view></view>